Modified for Codex Unified Model Router in 2026, derived from the adjacent
DeepSeek entry: Ultra Spark model identity, OpenRouter routing, the
router_instructions_suffix field, and main and persistent instructions
maintained in prompts/, including the ultra-spark.md delegation policy.

